    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mōror</span></b> , 1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. dep. n.</i>
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωρός</span>], <i>to be
				foolish, be a fool</i> (post-Aug.), in the lusus verbb.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">morari eum (Claudium) inter homines desiisse,
					productā primā syllabā,
					jocabatur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Ner. 33</span></i>
			.</div>
